    "body": "**Situation**\r\nThe position of the gdpr modul is on top of the page.\r\n\r\n**Problem 1**\r\nThe visitor is not able to change the language into a language (multilanguage shops) he can read and understand. The Cookie information is over the language selection. The visitor is forced to accept Cookies even he doesn't understand the language which is present at the initial opening of the site.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10166095/46074830-5e38ce80-c191-11e8-9f9a-9657dbbfab06.png)\r\n\r\n**Problem 2**\r\nOther languages need unicode or utf-8.\r\nSample: Wir verwenden Cookies, um Ihnen das bestm**ö**gliche Nutzererlebnis zu bieten.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10166095/46177218-c46d4080-c2ba-11e8-8dad-cdcd81a7a09d.png)\r\n\r\n**Problem 3**\r\nThe Cookie information is only shown up in the 1st language of the language configuration.\r\nIn this case only in German.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10166095/46246226-fdb0c800-c402-11e8-9479-5eee9a96183f.png)\r\n\r\n",
